    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d458">

                <pb facs="0618" n="604" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg604"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC
                    Indonesia/12–2548: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Batavia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Livengood</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Batavia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-12-25">December 25,
                        1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1157. Gocus 513. Following letter Dec. 25,
                    signed three GOC representatives, addressed and
                    delivered Schuurman this noon:</p>
                <p>[Here follows text printed in SC, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">3rd yr., Suppl.</hi> (Dec.), page 305.] Communication in
                    similar terms addressed and delivered to Secretary General Republic Delegation
                        Sudjono<anchor n="1" xml:id="d458-f1"/> who was released from custody
                    afternoon 24. Signed Cochran.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Livengood</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d458-f1" n="1" xml:id="d458-f1-content">
                <p>For text, see SC, <hi rendition="#italic">3rd yr.,
                        Suppl.</hi> (Dec.), page 306. For 6th GOC
                    report to SC, telegraphed “around 4 a. m. morning
                    26th” (transmitted in telegram 1158, December 26, Gocus 514, from Batavia, not printed), see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ibid.</hi>, document S/1156, p. 307. The Netherlands and Indonesian replies
                    to the GOC letters of December 25 are printed
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.</hi>, p. 309, as part of the report.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
